  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1722620637_1735516_3f9499ed07d98437cd7a76dd0e68d9ae.png",
  "description": "<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\">\r\n<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\">\r\n<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\">\r\n<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">FOCUS ON FUN and reduce fidgeting behaviors with MagStackers Magnet Tiles. Tetrahedron and tri-pyramidal magnet blocks can be manipulated to create fun and imaginative animal figures with eyes.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">100+ COMBINATIONS means hours of fun for all. Available in your choice of 10 colors, MagStackers combines the building fun of magnetic blocks with the learning potential of kids' STEM building toys.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">PREMIUM DESIGN includes impact-resistant ABS tiles embedded with super-powerful magnets. Non-toxic and with safe rounded edges, MagStackers are fun magnet toys for adults and kids 5 years and up.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">MAGSTACKER BUILDING TOYS are pleasing to kids and adults. They are eye-catching desk toys and engaging floor play toys for kids. Slip a couple of MagStackers into a pocket for fidget toys on the go.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<div class=\"product-description rte\" itemprop=\"description\">\r\n<div data-cel-widget=\"productDescription_feature_div\" data-csa-c-id=\"i73xd9-b1y5bx-q7o12o-bxgejq\" data-csa-c-is-in-initial-active-row=\"false\" data-csa-c-asin=\"\" data-csa-c-slot-id=\"productDescription_feature_div\" data-csa-c-content-id=\"productDescription\" data-csa-c-type=\"widget\" data-feature-name=\"productDescription\" class=\"celwidget\" id=\"productDescription_feature_div\">\r\n<div data-cel-widget=\"productDescription_feature_div\" class=\"a-row feature\" id=\"productDescription_feature_div\" data-template-name=\"productDescription\" data-feature-name=\"productDescription\">\r\n<div class=\"a-section a-spacing-small\"